{"id":"apuro","lemma":"apuro","pos":"noun","rank":3824,"glosses":["difficulty, predicament","shortage","urgency, rush, hurry"],"ipa":"/aˈpuɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"apuros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-apuro.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es el apuro?","en":"What's the hurry?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443733","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Estoy en apuros.","en":"I'm in a pickle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441755","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"No hay apuro.","en":"There's no hurry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444259","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Durante la guerra, la gente pasó muchos apuros.","en":"During the war, people went through many hardships.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705574","words":[{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to pass","l":"pasar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"Tomate tu tiempo, no hay apuro.","en":"Take your time. There's no rush.","words":[{"g":"tomato"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]}]}